  "no_colors_cause": "The arena palette asset /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary is never cooked into the packaged build: DefaultGame.ini only listed /Game/Data/Effects under DirectoriesToAlwaysCook, so the palette was absent from the pak. LoadObject in BeginPlay failed (log lines 4-6: 'Couldn't find file for package /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary', 'Palette is null, using fallback gray') and the HUD fell back to gray. Fixed by adding /Game/Data/Palettes to DirectoriesToAlwaysCook so the palette is always cooked."
